                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Supplementary table 1-3 for Chapter 6 - List of all differentially expressed genes (DEGs) per comparison. Each table shows the list of all DEGs for a given comparison, shown in separate tabs for up- or downregulated DEGs. Per DEG, the log2 Fold Change and adjusted p-value (padj) are shown. Data is shown for Ganetespib vs Control, 24h (table 1), PRRT + ganetespib vs PRRT, 24h (table 2) and PRRT + ganetespib vs PRRT, 72h (table 3). Data belongs to Chapter 6 \"Targeting heat shock protein 90 to radiosensitize neuroendocrine tumor cells to PRRT: mechanisms outside DNA double-strand break repair\" in PhD thesis ''Improving Peptide Receptor Radionuclide Outcomes - A Radiobiological Approach\" by Thom Reuvers (2024)."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
